#: templates/admin-wildcard-intro.php:2
msgid ""
"Wildcard swaps allow you to specify parts of strings, rather than the exact "
"full string. The wildcard will be replaced in all strings where it occurs, "
"unless that string has a specific replacement set up."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin-wildcard-intro.php:5
msgid ""
"Caution: Wildcard swaps are inefficient, and can slow down your site. Using "
"proper replacements is always preferred. "
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin-wildcard-intro.php:5
msgid ""
"Swaps may also produce undesireable results since they apply to all "
"translatable strings, e.g. swapping %1$smanage%2$s with %1$scontrol%2$s "
"would change %1$smanagement%2$s to %1$scontrolment%2$s"
msgstr ""

